        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 2.79m x 1.31m\nTiled floor.Double doors to hallway.\n\nHallway - 5.60m x 2.40m\nSolid wood oak floor.\n\nLiving Room - 4.60m x 3.84m\nSlate fireplace with ornate insert cast iron surround.Recessed lighting.Double doors connecting to kitchen area. Solid oak floor.Coving.\n\nKitchen - 6.89m x 3.45m\nHardwood work tops. Quality fitted units. Stanley stove with back boiler,Hot press.\n\nW/C/Utility - 2.71m x 0.98m\nFully tiled.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.99m x 2.95m\nBay window.Solid oak floor.Walk in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.70m x 2.15m\nFully tiled.Walk in shower unit.Electric shower.\n\nLower Ground Level Hallway - 3.47m x 1.76m\n\n\nLower Ground Level Hallway - 2.92m x 1.2m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.75m x 3.36m\nWood floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 2.40m\nWood floor.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.54m x 2.52m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.48m x 2.43m\nFully tiled.Pumped shower.Heated towel rail.\n\nGames Room/ Study - 7.55m x 2.80m\nPatio doors leading to back garden.\n\n"
